{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac </strong>is a first person narrative adventure game, where the player plays from the perspective of Rei, a girl who was left all alone in this world after her grandmother\u2019s passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/Rei_Place.gif?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/JE_resized.png?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a beautiful world of <strong>Bonds of the Zodiac </strong>, set in a rural Japanese Village and mysterious realms of the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/Sceenery.gif?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/Sceneery_Img.png?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relationships Between The Zodiacs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the Zodiacs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/Closeups_Zodiac.gif?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the relationships between the Zodiacs and the Jade Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help them solve conflicts and find salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manifested as strings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find ways to sever these bonds and help the Zodiacs gain their freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/String_Cut.png?t=1750783576\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Explore immersive environments through first-person exploration and narrative-driven gameplay. As Rei, interact with the spirits through meaningful dialogue choices, uncover their personal struggles, and mediate the conflicts that bind them. Help the Zodiacs gain their freedom by solving light environmental puzzles and guiding them through emotional story arcs. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Bonds of the Zodiac</i> focuses on introspective themes and internal discovery, making it ideal for fans of atmospheric, story-rich adventures. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game offers approximately 1.5 to 2.5 hours of playtime and includes a mood-rich soundtrack that blends relaxing, melancholic, and tense tracks, enhancing the emotional arc of the story.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805400?t=1750783576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/4967e8b92110cfdc7c7fbe7a70e464c2