uncover their personal struggles, and mediate the conflicts that bind them. Help the Zodiacs gain their freedom by solving light environmental puzzles and guiding them through emotional story arcs. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Bonds of the Zodiac</i> focuses on introspective themes and internal discovery, making it ideal for fans of atmospheric, story-rich adventures. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game offers approximately 1.5 to 2.5 hours of playtime and includes a mood-rich soundtrack that blends relaxing, melancholic, and tense tracks, enhancing the emotional arc of the story.</strong></p>","developers":["Alex X"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/900043245a2efc6d548d831bd52b81056e33379c/header.jpg?t=1750783576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158457,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158457/movie480.mp4?t=1750783574","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158457/movie_max.mp4?t=1750783574"},"name":"Bonds of the Zodiac - Announcement Trailer 0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158457/cd46ab12f0c13e0a7cded8a6b0f7f8e7f6265377/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750783574","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158457/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750783574","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158457/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750783574"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257152565,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.